OL,3,GNEWSAHow Hop Tu Naa decorations are
OL,4,Ahelping to create family traditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FGhosts, witches and perhaps even a few
OL,7,FK-Pop Demon Hunters will be spotted
OL,8,Fgoing house to house on Saturday,
OL,9,Fsinging about Jinny the Witch and
OL,10,Fcollecting treats.
OL,12,FChildren across the Isle of Man will be
OL,13,Fcelebrating Hop Tu Naa, the island's
OL,14,Foldest unbroken tradition. Marked on 31
OL,15,FOctober, the Celtic festival signals
OL,16,Fthe transition from summer to winter
OL,17,Fand is often compared with Halloween.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
