OL,3,GNEWSAHow Hop Tu Naa decorations are
OL,4,Ahelping to create family traditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it is considered the Celtic
OL,7,FNew Year, celebrating the safe
OL,8,Fgathering of the harvest and marking
OL,9,Fthe point at which people prepared for
OL,10,Fthe colder months ahead.
OL,12,FFor the Pulrose family, decorating
OL,13,Ftheir home for Hop Tu Naa is a
OL,14,Ftradition that stretches back to
OL,15,Fgrandfather Anthony Dooley's childhood.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
